[2025-10-22 20:29:32.820321] STATS: 
[2025-10-22 20:29:32.820322] STATS: ENCODING: S → class_id
[2025-10-22 20:29:32.820323] STATS:   1. Sort speaker IDs: S' = sorted(S)
[2025-10-22 20:29:32.820324] STATS:   2. Find lexicographic index of S'
[2025-10-22 20:29:32.820325] STATS: 
[2025-10-22 20:29:32.820326] STATS: DECODING: class_id → S
[2025-10-22 20:29:32.820327] STATS:   1. Find k: Σ(j=0 to k-1) C(5,j) ≤ class_id < Σ(j=0 to k) C(5,j)
[2025-10-22 20:29:32.820329] STATS:   2. Reconstruct combination from remaining index
[2025-10-22 20:29:32.820330] STATS: 
